  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• <p>• Preheat oven to 220°C/200°C fan-forced.<br>• Grate carrot. Drain and rinse lentils.<br>• Finely chop tomato. </p>",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/68f7009ac310625e17190ea3/step-46efc800.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• <p>• In a large frying pan, heat a drizzle of olive oil over medium-high heat. Cook carrot, stirring, until softened, 4-5 mins.<br>• Add tomato paste and All-American spice blend and cook until fragrant, 1 min.<br>• Stir in lentils, baby spinach, the BBQ sauce, salt, water and butter, then cook until slightly thickened, 2-3 mins. Season with pepper.</p>",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/68f7009ac310625e17190ea3/step-529d2a10.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• <p>• Arrange tortillas over lined oven tray. Divide lentil mixture among tortillas, <br>spooning it onto half of each side. Top with Cheddar cheese.<br>• Fold empty half of each tortilla over to enclose filling and gently press down with a spatula. Brush or spray tortillas with a drizzle of olive oil and season.<br>• Bake quesadillas until cheese has melted and tortillas are golden, 10-12 mins. Spoon any overflowing filling and cheese back into quesadillas.</p>",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/68f7009ac310625e17190ea3/step-d391c820.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• <p>• In a medium bowl, combine tomato and a drizzle of white wine vinegar and <br>olive oil.<br>• Divide quesadillas between plates. Top with zingy tomatoes. Serve with yoghurt.</p>",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/68f7009ac310625e17190ea3/step-971c2930.jpg"
    }
  ]
}
